# Ascension calculation reverse engineering (ethical)

User mandate: **always** practice Ascension calc RE as part of Buildschmiede work.
Prefer **level-run 10–59** usefulness over L60 purity when they conflict (see `AGENTS.md`).

How agents work / ship: `.cursor/rules/full-agent-utilization.mdc`.

## Do (ethical RE)

- Mine **AscensionDBC**, tooltip text, and **Safe** live Ascension APIs for real numbers:
  CD, cost, range, cast, charges, weapon %, flats from description text
- Improve `sync_tooltips`, `scaling`, `methods`, `mechanics` (and related pipeline) from measured data
- **Never invent** SP/AP coefficients (or other ratios) missing from data — omit or mark missing
- Document findings in `pipeline/NOTES-*.md`
- Read-only client extracts for research are fine; derived JSON/notes go in repo

## Don't

- Invent coefficients / guess SP–AP ratios / fabricate tooltip numbers
- Commit proprietary Ascension/Blizzard client Lua
- Exe decompile, anticheat bypass, memory hacks, or other client-tampering RE

